  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\nGiven equation : 104 ÷ 8 – 24 × 5 + 9 = 34\n\nNow, by interchanging the signs\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : + and ÷\n\n104 ÷ 8 – 24 × 5 + 9 = 34 ⇒ 104 + 8 – 24 × 5 ÷ 9 = 34\n\n104 + 8 – 24 × **5 **____**÷**____** 9**__ = 34\n\n104 + 8 – __**24 × 0.5**5__ = 34\n\n__**104 + 8**__ – 13.2 = 34\n\n__**112 – 13.2**__ = 34\n\n98.8 ≠ 34 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : – and +\n\n104 ÷ 8 – 24 × 5 + 9 = 34 ⇒ 104 ÷ 8 + 24 × 5 - 9 = 34\n\n**104 ÷ 8**__ + 24 × 5 - 9 = 34\n\n13 + __**24 × 5**__ - 9 = 34\n\n__**13 + 120**__ - 9 = 34\n\n__**133 - 9**__ = 34\n\n124 ≠ 34 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : + and ×\n\n104 ÷ 8 – 24 × 5 + 9 = 34 ⇒ 104 ÷ 8 – 24 + 5 × 9 = 34\n\n**104 ÷ 8**__ – 24 + 5 × 9 = 34\n\n13 – 24 + __**5 **____**×**____** 9**__ = 34\n\n__**13 + 45**__ - 24 = 34\n\n__**58 - 24**__ = 34\n\n**34 = 34 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : ÷ and ×\n\n104 ÷ 8 – 24 × 5 + 9 = 34 ⇒ 104 × 8 – 24 ÷ 5 + 9 = 34\n\n104 × 8 – **24 **____**÷**____** 5**__ + 9 = 34\n\n__**104 ×**____** 8**__ – 4.8 + 9 = 34\n\n__**832 + 9**__ - 4.8 = 34\n\n__**841 - 4.8**__ = 34\n\n836.2 ≠ 34 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (3)\" is the correct answer.",
